 "remarks": "Location, location, location! Sunny and spacious condominium offers a living room, dining room, eat-in kitchen, 1 bedroom, 1 full bathroom, plenty of closet space, and a balcony with views. Fountain Terrace Complex is located within minutes of parks, shopping centers, restaurants, theaters, and all downtown Stamford amenities. Enjoy access to an in-ground pool, fitness center, kids' playground, and clubhouse. The building has 24-hour security, laundry in the basement, and a reserved parking space. Common charges include heat, hot water, and cooking gas. Pets are allowed! Excellent opportunity for first-time home buyers. Why pay rent when you can own!",
